  "limitations": [
    "This deliberately preserves the near-term operating outcome. It omits 2027-2030 unit/ASP misses, package qualification delays, PC downside, Foundry breakeven timing and correlated financing needs; it is not a full business bear/bull envelope.",
    "Because the test only alters cash after2030, it cannot establish a2027-2028 repricing catalyst. It tests whether current value depends on plausible continuation economics and whether a high long-run return requires unusually favorable assumptions.",
    "The current model host external-sales denominator is not a fully reconciled consolidated-revenue statement. Use it only consistently for the existing capital convention; do not present it as issuer guidance or exact reported revenue.",
    "Attractive terminal cash does not make current external customer awards or technology readiness equivalent to enforceable profits. No new14A waiver or free option is inserted.",
    "The scope of a3-5year competition recommendation still needs an explicit directional judgment after examining scenarios. This policy supplies comparisons rather than that judgment."
  ],
