      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "locators": [
        "PDF pages 5-7"
      ],
      "facts": "DCAI reported approximately 42% operating margin; purpose-built silicon grew above 50% sequentially. Intel described lower Intel 3/18A costs, ongoing Foundry losses, and strongly higher planned 2027 capital spending.",
      "inference": "High product margins are currently feasible; the future blend is uncertain. Better process economics and additional investment can occur together. Product margin, manufacturing profit and capital efficiency cannot be credited repeatedly for one improvement."
